# Version-control .claude/skills/ (the shared LLM-deployment skills) while
# keeping every other .claude/ entry (personal settings, worktrees, memory,
# IDE config) local and untracked. `!.claude/` also guards against
# environments that globally ignore .claude/ (e.g. a ~/.gitignore_global rule).
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Version-control .codex/skills/ (the Codex equivalent of the shared
# LLM-deployment skills) while keeping other repo-local Codex state local.
!.codex/
.codex/*
!.codex/skills/

# make artifacts
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
platforms/scripts/env_config
platforms/scripts/br_config

# build artifacts
*.cmd
*.jou
*.log
*.xsa
.Xil
.ipcache
bootgen_log.txt
final_vck5000.pdi
_x
vck5000_aie_base_graph_hw.ltx
vck5000_aie_base_graph_hw.xsa.link_summary
Work
build
build_*
build-xrt
install
install-xrt
# Out-of-tree toolchain trees checked out beside the build dirs. 25 GB between them, and
# untracked-but-not-ignored is the dangerous state: one `git add -A` stages the lot.
# Anchored, so a future programming_examples/*/llvm/ is not silently swallowed too.
/llvm/
/my_install/
# Kernel objects and aircc output written to the REPO ROOT by a build run from the wrong cwd
# (twelve *.o, air.mlir and coarse_cache/ were committed this way once). Anchored to the root.
/*.o
/air.mlir
/coarse_cache/
platform_repo
myproj
sw_comp
sd_card
sysroot
components
air_project
__pycache__/
sandbox
agents/.state/

# Study and measurement result trees (Phase F/G). A completed results root is
# ~2.4 GB and an unattended runner writes one tree per run.
#
# Scoped to result TREES, deliberately not to the *.csv extension that iron's
# rule set uses. A blanket `*.csv` silently ignores any CSV a future test wants
# to track as a fixture, and the failure mode is a file that seems to commit and
# does not. iron's own rules carry two negations to claw specific files back out
# from under exactly that -- evidence they hit it. Measurements belong in a
# result tree; if a CSV is being written outside one, that is the thing to fix.
results/
results_unattended_*/

# build results
libadf.a
*.elf
*.elf.*
CLAUDE.md

# documents
*.pdf

# MkDocs build outputs / CI-generated docs pages (generated by generateDocs.yml)
/site/
/docs/programming_examples/
/docs/llms/
/docs/AIRDialect.md
/docs/AIRRtDialect.md
/docs/AIRConversionPasses.md
/docs/AIRTransformPasses.md
/docs/AIRTransformOps.md
/docs/build_info.json
